# Instamart portal: the cached signer wasm and the saved browser session.
# The wasm is Swiggy's own public asset (re-fetched on demand); the session
# file is a logged-in browser profile, so it never belongs in git.
scraper/platforms/instamart/dashboard_data/seller/_signer_cache/
# Blinkit seller (seller.blinkit.com): the persistent Chromium profile that
# IS the login credential for this domain — see seller_new.py's docstring.
platform_auth/marketplaces/blinkit/_seller_new_profiles/
# Supply Portal: the cached abacus-token is a live bearer credential.
scraper/platforms/instamart/dashboard_data/supply/_token_cache/
staging/instamart_reports/
